1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,480
[♪♪♪]

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,600
I'm Peppa Pig. 
[SNORTS]

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,160
This is my little brother
George.
[GRUNTS]

4
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,600
This is Mommy Pig.
[SNORTS]

5
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,920
And this is Daddy Pig.

6
00:00:11,920 --> 00:00:13,280
[GRUNTS]
[ALL LAUGHING]

7
00:00:14,319 --> 00:00:15,920
Peppa Pig.
[GRUNTS]

8
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:16,960
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

9
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:20,919
[♪♪♪]

10
00:00:20,919 --> 00:00:23,640
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

11
00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:25,919
[♪♪♪]

12
00:00:25,919 --> 00:00:28,759
[TV CHARACTERS GIBBERING]
[PEPPA &amp; GEORGE LAUGHING]

13
00:00:28,759 --> 00:00:29,799
[GRUNTS]

14
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:34,879
[GIBBERING]
[LAUGHING]

15
00:00:34,879 --> 00:00:36,120
[CHUCKLING]

16
00:00:36,120 --> 00:00:38,000
NARRATOR:
Daddy Pig wears glasses.

17
00:00:40,199 --> 00:00:43,440
He needs to wear glasses,
to see clearly.

18
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:47,000
When Daddy Pig wears his
glasses, everything looks fine.

19
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:48,720
[GIBBERING]

20
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:52,160
NARRATOR: But when Daddy Pig
takes his glasses off...

21
00:00:52,160 --> 00:00:55,559
he can't see things clearly.

22
00:00:55,559 --> 00:00:58,960
Everything looks
a bit soft and fuzzy.

23
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:01,160
So, it is very important

24
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:03,760
that Daddy Pig knows
where his glasses are.

25
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:08,039
[GIBBERING]

26
00:01:08,039 --> 00:01:12,119
[GRUNTS]
Hm.

27
00:01:12,119 --> 00:01:15,440
[BOTH LAUGHING]

28
00:01:15,440 --> 00:01:18,920
NARRATOR: Sometimes Daddy Pig
loses his glasses.

29
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,759
Peppa. George.

30
00:01:20,759 --> 00:01:22,960
Have you seen
Daddy Pig's glasses?

31
00:01:22,960 --> 00:01:24,839
He can't find them
anywhere.

32
00:01:24,839 --> 00:01:27,160
[GRUNTS]
No, Mommy.
[GRUNTS]

33
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:30,520
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George do not know
where Daddy Pig's glasses are.

34
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,880
[SNORTS]
Oh, dear.

35
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:35,119
Daddy Pig cannot see
a thing without them.

36
00:01:35,119 --> 00:01:37,360
And it makes him
very grumpy.

37
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:40,160
[SNORTS]

38
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,640
NARRATOR:
Without his glasses on,

39
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:44,600
Daddy Pig cannot read
his newspaper.

40
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:46,600
[SNORT]
This is ridiculous!

41
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:48,800
I can't see anything!

42
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:51,640
Somebody must have put
my glasses somewhere.

43
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:55,119
[SNORTS]
Do you remember where you
last put them, Daddy Pig?

44
00:01:55,119 --> 00:01:58,199
When I don't wear them,
I always put them in my pocket.

45
00:01:58,199 --> 00:02:01,039
[SNORTS]
But they aren't there now.

46
00:02:01,039 --> 00:02:04,360
Daddy! Can we help
find your glasses?

47
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,919
MOMMY PIG:
Good idea, Peppa.

48
00:02:05,919 --> 00:02:09,320
If you find them, Daddy will
stop being so grumpy.

49
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,600
I'm not grumpy.
[SNORTS]

50
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:13,799
[ALL LAUGHING]

51
00:02:13,799 --> 00:02:16,840
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are looking
for Daddy's glasses.

52
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:20,320
NARRATOR:
Peppa looks under
the newspaper.

53
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:23,000
But Daddy Pig's glasses
are not there.

54
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,200
Oh.

55
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:27,480
NARRATOR:
George looks on top
of the television.

56
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:29,799
But Daddy Pig's glasses
are not there.

57
00:02:29,799 --> 00:02:31,200
Oh.

58
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:36,359
[SNORTS]
Let's look upstairs,
in Mommy and Daddy's bedroom!

59
00:02:36,359 --> 00:02:39,720
[GRUNTING, GIGGLING] 

60
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:47,079
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are looking in
Mommy and Daddy Pig's bedroom.

61
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:50,679
George, be careful not
to knock anything over.

62
00:02:50,679 --> 00:02:53,000
Ah!

63
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:56,400
[SNORTS, LAUGHS]

64
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,799
It's not funny.

65
00:03:02,519 --> 00:03:04,280
NARRATOR:
Peppa looks under the pillows.

66
00:03:04,280 --> 00:03:06,600
But Daddy Pig's glasses
are not there.

67
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,840
Oh.

68
00:03:09,239 --> 00:03:11,440
NARRATOR: George looks
in Daddy's slippers.

69
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:14,079
But the glasses
are not there either.

70
00:03:14,079 --> 00:03:16,679
[SNIFFS, COUGHS]

71
00:03:16,679 --> 00:03:18,600
[GIGGLES, GRUNTS]

72
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,000
Let's look in the bathroom!

73
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:22,720
[BOTH LAUGH]

74
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:25,280
NARRATOR: Peppa and George
are looking in the bathroom.

75
00:03:26,399 --> 00:03:28,600
The glasses
are not in the bath.

76
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,640
Oh.

77
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:32,679
The glasses are not
in the toilet.

78
00:03:32,679 --> 00:03:34,079
[ECHOES]
Oh.

79
00:03:34,079 --> 00:03:35,720
Hm.
[SNORTS]

80
00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:38,560
It's too difficult.
[GRUNTS]

81
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,760
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George cannot find

82
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,959
Daddy Pig's glasses anywhere.

83
00:03:44,959 --> 00:03:47,040
[SNORTS]
We've looked everywhere.

84
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,280
But we can't find
Daddy's glasses.

85
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:52,840
Oh, dear.
Now what can we do?

86
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,679
I suppose I'll just have
to learn to do without them.

87
00:03:55,679 --> 00:04:00,160
[SNORTS]
If I move slowly
I won't bump into things.

88
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:02,040
[GRUNTS]
There they are!

89
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:04,920
Daddy's glasses!

90
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:06,440
[SNORTS]
Daddy Pig.

91
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:09,040
You were sitting
on them all the time!

92
00:04:09,040 --> 00:04:11,480
Oh...

93
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,880
[LAUGHS]
Silly Daddy!

94
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,760
[LAUGHS, GRUNTS]

95
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,800
I don't know how they got there.

96
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:22,840
[LAUGHS]
I wonder how!

97
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:24,640
[GRUNTING, LAUGHING]

98
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,560
He-he-he-he-he!
[GRUNTS]

99
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:30,440
Well, you may have been
a bit silly, Daddy Pig,

100
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:33,200
but at least you're
not grumpy anymore!

101
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,479
I was not grumpy.

102
00:04:35,479 --> 00:04:38,080
[LAUGHING, GRUNTING]

103
00:04:38,080 --> 00:04:39,919
[LAUGHING, GRUNTING]

104
00:04:39,919 --> 00:04:42,120
[ALL GUFFAWING]

105
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:50,760
[♪♪♪]

106
00:04:50,760 --> 00:04:52,200
[HORN HONKS]

107
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,320
[PEPPA READS ONSCREEN TEXT]

108
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,800
[♪♪♪]

109
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:56,440
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are playing

110
00:04:56,440 --> 00:04:58,719
at Granny Pig
and Grandpa Pig's house.

111
00:04:58,719 --> 00:05:00,680
[GIGGLING]

112
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,520
Grandpa! Catch!

113
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,960
Ho-ho-ho!
[SNORTS]

114
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,919
Catch!
[LAUGHS]

115
00:05:08,919 --> 00:05:10,280
He-he-he.
[SNORTS]

116
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:11,960
What's this?

117
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:15,400
Dine-saw! Grrrrr!

118
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:18,599
A dinosaur!
[LAUGHING]

119
00:05:18,599 --> 00:05:20,560
Grandpa,
what are you doing?

120
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:23,760
I'm planting these seeds.

121
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:26,520
Seeds?
What do seeds do?

122
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:29,599
Seeds grow into plants.

123
00:05:29,599 --> 00:05:34,359
I just make a little hole
and put the seed in.

124
00:05:34,359 --> 00:05:37,840
Then I cover it with earth
and water it.

125
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:40,240
[SNORTS]
Everything in my garden

126
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:44,359
grows from tiny seeds
like these.

127
00:05:44,359 --> 00:05:46,200
Even the big apple tree?

128
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,479
Oh! Yes!

129
00:05:47,479 --> 00:05:50,120
[SNORTS]
This tiny seed

130
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:54,280
will grow into a little
apple tree like this.

131
00:05:54,280 --> 00:05:55,800
Snort!
BOTH: Ooh.

132
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,120
And that
little apple tree

133
00:05:58,120 --> 00:06:02,440
will grow into
a big apple tree like this.

134
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,719
Ouch!
[SNORTS]

135
00:06:05,719 --> 00:06:08,359
Mm.
[CRUNCHES]

136
00:06:08,359 --> 00:06:10,200
[BOTH GIGGLING]

137
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:11,640
[LAUGHS, SNORTS]

138
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:16,120
And inside this apple
are more seeds.

139
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:18,680
[SNORTS]
To make more apple trees!

140
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,719
Exactly!

141
00:06:20,719 --> 00:06:23,039
Grandpa! Grandpa!
[SNORTS]

142
00:06:23,039 --> 00:06:25,000
I want to plant a seed!

143
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,479
Would you like to plant
a strawberry seed?

144
00:06:27,479 --> 00:06:29,039
Yes, please!

145
00:06:29,039 --> 00:06:35,039
This seed will grow into
a lovely strawberry plant.

146
00:06:35,039 --> 00:06:38,760
First,
make a little hole.

147
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:41,000
Then I put the seed in...

148
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,159
and cover it with earth.

149
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:45,280
Shall I water it for you?

150
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,560
No! No!
[SNORTS]

151
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:48,200
I want to water it.

152
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,159
Good!
[GRUNTS]

153
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:53,840
Now we wait for it
to grow.

154
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:59,919
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are waiting
for the seed to grow.

155
00:06:59,919 --> 00:07:02,960
[GRUNTS]
It's not doing anything!

156
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,520
No-ho-ho-ho-ho-ho.

157
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:06,880
You'll have to be
patient, Peppa.

158
00:07:06,880 --> 00:07:09,919
[SNORTS]
It will take
a long time to grow.

159
00:07:09,919 --> 00:07:12,840
Peppa! George!
It's time to go home.

160
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:16,000
But we're waiting for my
strawberry plant to grow!

161
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:19,640
[SNORTS]
I wanted
strawberries for tea.

162
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:21,599
GRANDPA PIG:
Don't worry, Peppa.

163
00:07:21,599 --> 00:07:23,599
[SNORTS]
Next time you come,

164
00:07:23,599 --> 00:07:26,400
the seed will have grown
into a plant.

165
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:29,280
[SNORTS]
And we'll have strawberries!

166
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:30,960
Yes!

167
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:33,159
[SNORT]
Come on, Peppa.

168
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,760
Bye bye, Grandpa.

169
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,479
Bye bye, strawberry.

170
00:07:36,479 --> 00:07:38,520
[KISSES, GIGGLES]

171
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,719
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

172
00:07:39,719 --> 00:07:42,239
[STARTS ENGINE, HONKS]

173
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:47,599
NARRATOR: Grandpa Pig looks
after Peppa's strawberry plant.

174
00:07:47,599 --> 00:07:52,400
After many days, Grandpa Pig
finds a tiny plant growing.

175
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:55,840
Day by day, the plant grows
bigger and bigger.

176
00:07:55,840 --> 00:07:59,679
Then one day, Grandpa Pig finds
something very special.

177
00:07:59,679 --> 00:08:01,760
GRANDPA PIG:
Strawberries!

178
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:04,239
[SNORTS]
Grandpa! We're back!

179
00:08:04,239 --> 00:08:05,840
[SNORTS]

180
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:08,159
NARRATOR: Peppa and George
have come to play again.

181
00:08:08,159 --> 00:08:10,880
Grandpa! Grandpa!
Did my plant grow?

182
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:14,479
Yes! Look!
BOTH: Ooh!

183
00:08:14,479 --> 00:08:16,880
Strawberries!

184
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,080
[BOTH GIGGLING]

185
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,200
[SNORTS]
Thank you, Grandpa!

186
00:08:20,200 --> 00:08:24,880
[NIBBLING]

187
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,679
Grandpa, can we plant
something else?

188
00:08:27,679 --> 00:08:29,000
Yes!
[SNORTS]

189
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,840
Now it's George's turn
to choose.

190
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:35,039
[GRUNTS]
Yes! You choose, George.

191
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:36,919
Choose a carrot!

192
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,959
[SNORTS]
Grandpa,

193
00:08:38,959 --> 00:08:41,600
I think George wants
to grow a carrot.

194
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:45,160
George, would you
like to grow a carrot?

195
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:47,199
[GRUNTS]
No!

196
00:08:47,199 --> 00:08:49,600
What would you like to grow?

197
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,360
[SNORTS]

198
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:54,199
NARRATOR: George has thought
of something he wants to grow.

199
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:58,880
[SNORTS]
Dine-saw!

200
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:01,520
NARRATOR: George wants
to grow a dinosaur tree!

201
00:09:01,520 --> 00:09:04,160
[GIGGLES]
Silly George!

202
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:07,199
[SNORTS]
Dinosaurs don't
grow on trees.

203
00:09:07,199 --> 00:09:12,880
[ALL LAUGHING]

204
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:16,880
Dine-saw! Grrr!

205
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,000
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

206
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:23,000
[♪♪♪]

207
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,480
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

208
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:29,079
[♪♪♪]

209
00:09:29,079 --> 00:09:30,839
[CRUNCHING]

210
00:09:30,839 --> 00:09:34,880
NARRATOR: Peppa, George, Mommy
and Daddy are having breakfast.

211
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:36,480
It is a lovely,
sunny day,

212
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:38,439
and Peppa and George
can't wait

213
00:09:38,439 --> 00:09:40,120
to go into the garden
to play.

214
00:09:40,120 --> 00:09:43,839
[SNORTS]
Mommy, please can
we go out to play?

215
00:09:43,839 --> 00:09:47,439
[SNORTS]
You can go out to play
when you finish your breakfast.

216
00:09:47,439 --> 00:09:50,680
[MUNCHING, SLURPING]

217
00:09:51,640 --> 00:09:53,880
[CRUNCHES, SLURPS]

218
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:55,120
George!
[SNORTS]

219
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,880
Don't drink your juice
too quickly!

220
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:01,240
[HICCUPS]
[GIGGLES]

221
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,839
[HICCUPS]
He-he-he!

222
00:10:02,839 --> 00:10:05,000
NARRATOR: George drank
his juice too quickly,

223
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
and now he has hiccups.

224
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,880
[HICCUPS]
[ALL LAUGH]

225
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:12,400
[SNORTS]
Can we go out
to play now, Mommy?

226
00:10:12,400 --> 00:10:14,760
Not while
George has hiccups.

227
00:10:14,760 --> 00:10:16,800
But George's hiccups
have gone, Mommy.

228
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,800
Haven't they, George?

229
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,160
[HICCUPS]

230
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,959
[ALL LAUGH]

231
00:10:23,959 --> 00:10:27,000
[SNORTS]
Oh, all right, you can
go out and play.

232
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,680
But look after George.

233
00:10:28,680 --> 00:10:33,800
[♪♪♪]

234
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:37,480
NARRATOR: Peppa and George love
playing in the garden.

235
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,680
George. I'm going
to throw the ball,

236
00:10:39,680 --> 00:10:42,120
and then you
have to catch it.

237
00:10:42,120 --> 00:10:44,400
[HICCUPS]
George.

238
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,079
Please stop hiccuping!

239
00:10:48,439 --> 00:10:51,280
[HICCUPS]
George!

240
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:56,800
Now you throw the ball to me
and I have to catch it.

241
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,079
[HICCUPS]

242
00:10:59,719 --> 00:11:01,480
George!

243
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:04,719
NARRATOR: Oh dear, George's
hiccups are spoiling the game.

244
00:11:05,800 --> 00:11:08,560
George, I know
how to cure hiccups!

245
00:11:09,719 --> 00:11:12,280
You have to do what I say.

246
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:14,520
[HICCUPS]
[GIGGLES]

247
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:18,319
[SNORTS]
Rub the top of your head
and rub your tummy.

248
00:11:22,280 --> 00:11:25,000
Good! Now your hiccups
have gone!

249
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:27,959
[HICCUPS]

250
00:11:27,959 --> 00:11:29,360
NARRATOR:
Peppa's cure for hiccups

251
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,000
doesn't seem to have worked.

252
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:33,560
George! You have done it
all wrong!

253
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:38,719
I know better way
to cure hiccups!

254
00:11:38,719 --> 00:11:43,319
First, jump up and down
three times on one leg!

255
00:11:46,319 --> 00:11:49,760
Now, wave your arms
up and down,

256
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:53,880
and stick your tongue out!
[BLOWS RASPBERRY]

257
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:58,680
[BLOWS RASPBERRIES]

258
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,040
And now,
close your eyes,

259
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:04,839
and turn around quickly,
three times!

260
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:10,959
[HICCUPS]

261
00:12:10,959 --> 00:12:13,240
NARRATOR: Peppa's new cure
hasn't worked either,

262
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:17,360
George still has hiccups.
[HICCUPS]

263
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:18,839
I know!

264
00:12:18,839 --> 00:12:24,199
To cure hiccups, the ill piggy
must be given a shock!

265
00:12:24,199 --> 00:12:26,160
George,
I'm going to scare you.

266
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:27,560
But you must remember,

267
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:30,959
it's only a game and it will
stop your hiccups.

268
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:37,439
Remember, this is
just pretend scaring.

269
00:12:39,880 --> 00:12:42,719
[GRUNTS LOUDLY]

270
00:12:42,719 --> 00:12:45,160
[CRYING]

271
00:12:45,160 --> 00:12:46,520
MOMMY PIG:
Peppa!

272
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:49,079
You mustn't play
so roughly with George!

273
00:12:49,079 --> 00:12:50,959
He's only little.

274
00:12:50,959 --> 00:12:52,160
Sorry, Mommy.

275
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:55,280
I was trying to stop
George's hiccups.

276
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:57,319
[SNORTS]

277
00:12:57,319 --> 00:12:59,480
NARRATOR:
George's hiccups have gone!

278
00:13:02,520 --> 00:13:05,520
NARRATOR:
Here comes Daddy Pig,
with two beakers of juice.

279
00:13:05,520 --> 00:13:06,760
[SNORTS]

280
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:10,480
George!
If you drink too quickly,

281
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:12,160
you will get hiccups again!

282
00:13:12,160 --> 00:13:14,640
I'm not as little
as George,

283
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:17,640
I can drink juice
as quickly as I want to!

284
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:18,959
[SLURPS]

285
00:13:18,959 --> 00:13:20,920
[BIRDS CHIRPING]

286
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,160
[HICCUPS]

287
00:13:22,160 --> 00:13:26,160
[LAUGHS]

288
00:13:27,560 --> 00:13:29,120
[HICCUPS]

289
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:34,439
[ALL LAUGH, SNORT]

290
00:13:35,839 --> 00:13:38,880
[HICCUPS, GIGGLES]

291
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:41,199
[ALL GUFFAWING]
[HICCUPS]

292
00:13:43,839 --> 00:13:47,880
[HICCUPS, GIGGLES]

293
00:13:48,800 --> 00:13:52,560
[♪♪♪]

294
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:54,079
[BICYCLE BELL RINGS]

295
00:13:54,079 --> 00:13:55,800
[PEPPA READING ONSCREEN TEXT]

296
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:58,640
NARRATOR:
It is a lovely sunny day,

297
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:02,280
and Peppa and George
are riding their bicycles.

298
00:14:02,280 --> 00:14:04,400
[BOTH CHUCKLING]

299
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:05,920
[BICYCLE BELL RINGS]

300
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:08,680
[SNORTS]
That's a fine pumpkin,
Daddy Pig!

301
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:11,599
NARRATOR: Daddy Pig is
very proud of his pumpkin.

302
00:14:11,599 --> 00:14:13,640
Pumpkins are the only
thing I can grow.

303
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:17,439
Probably because
I love pumpkin pie!
[SNORTS]

304
00:14:17,439 --> 00:14:18,640
[BICYCLE BELL RINGS]

305
00:14:18,640 --> 00:14:19,920
Come on, George.
[PANTING]

306
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:22,439
Danny, Suzy, Rebecca!

307
00:14:22,439 --> 00:14:24,800
NARRATOR: Peppa and her friends
Danny Dog, Suzy Sheep,

308
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:27,760
and Rebecca Rabbit are riding
their bicycles.

309
00:14:27,760 --> 00:14:30,199
George is riding
his tricycle.

310
00:14:30,199 --> 00:14:32,160
He's going so slowly.

311
00:14:32,160 --> 00:14:35,000
[ALL LAUGHING]
[PANTING, SNORTS]

312
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:38,400
Woof! Let's race
to Daddy Pig's pumpkin.

313
00:14:38,400 --> 00:14:40,680
PEPPA:
If we race to
Daddy's pumpkin,

314
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:44,000
we have be very careful
not to bump into it.

315
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:48,319
[SNORTS]
Daddy would be very sad
if the pumpkin got broken.

316
00:14:48,319 --> 00:14:50,079
Don't worry, Peppa.
Race you! Woof! Woof!

317
00:14:50,079 --> 00:14:52,079
[LAUGHING]
[BICYCLE BELLS RINGING]

318
00:14:52,079 --> 00:14:55,040
NARRATOR:
Peppa and her friends are
racing to Daddy Pig's pumpkin!

319
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:58,800
Hey! Watch out
for my pumpkin!

320
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:00,079
Hooray! Woof! Woof!

321
00:15:00,079 --> 00:15:02,040
[LAUGHING]
[BELLS RING]

322
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:04,560
MOMMY PIG:
Peppa! Look out!

323
00:15:04,560 --> 00:15:07,719
Daddy's pumpkin!
Ah!

324
00:15:07,719 --> 00:15:09,640
Sorry, Daddy!
[SNORTS]

325
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,120
[BICYCLE BELL RINGS]

326
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:14,199
PEPPA:
Look at George!
He's going so slowly!

327
00:15:14,199 --> 00:15:15,719
[CHUCKLES, GRUNTS]

328
00:15:15,719 --> 00:15:19,079
George is still riding
a baby bike!

329
00:15:19,079 --> 00:15:22,520
Woof! Yours is a baby bike
too, Peppa!

330
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:25,240
You've still got
stabilizers!

331
00:15:25,240 --> 00:15:27,880
I can ride
without my stabilizers.

332
00:15:27,880 --> 00:15:30,040
Baaa! Me too.

333
00:15:30,040 --> 00:15:31,839
And me. Woof! Woof!

334
00:15:31,839 --> 00:15:33,839
[♪♪♪]

335
00:15:33,839 --> 00:15:36,040
Let's ride up
the hill again! Woof!

336
00:15:36,040 --> 00:15:37,479
Are you coming, Peppa?

337
00:15:37,479 --> 00:15:40,360
No, I think I'll stay here.

338
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:43,400
Woof! Woof!
Baaa! See you later!

339
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:45,400
Bye.

340
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:49,199
NARRATOR:
Peppa wishes she did not have
stabilizers on her bicycle.

341
00:15:49,199 --> 00:15:53,079
[SNORTS]
Daddy, I don't want
stabilizers anymore.

342
00:15:53,079 --> 00:15:55,400
Do you think you can ride
without them?

343
00:15:55,400 --> 00:15:56,800
[SNORTS]
Yes.

344
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:59,800
All right, Peppa.
Let's take them off.

345
00:15:59,800 --> 00:16:02,120
NARRATOR:
Daddy Pig is taking
the stabilizers

346
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:03,959
off Peppa's bicycle.

347
00:16:03,959 --> 00:16:07,000
Are you sure you want to ride
without stabilizers?

348
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,240
Yes!

349
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:10,000
You've never done it before.

350
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,959
[SNORTS]
I can do it. I can, I can.

351
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:17,319
Aah!
[GIGGLING]

352
00:16:17,319 --> 00:16:19,880
[SNORTS]
It's not funny!

353
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:22,640
NARRATOR: Riding without
stabilizers is not easy.

354
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:24,719
[SNORTS]
Would you like some help, Peppa?

355
00:16:24,719 --> 00:16:26,520
Yes, please, Daddy.

356
00:16:26,520 --> 00:16:28,240
All right.
[SNORTS]

357
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:31,560
Ready. Steady. Go!

358
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,439
Don't let go, Daddy!

359
00:16:33,439 --> 00:16:36,000
Don't worry.
I've got you.

360
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,719
You're doing
really well, Peppa.

361
00:16:38,719 --> 00:16:40,040
[GRUNTS]

362
00:16:40,040 --> 00:16:41,880
Hold on, Daddy!

363
00:16:41,880 --> 00:16:43,599
Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!
Just keep pedaling.

364
00:16:43,599 --> 00:16:45,520
[♪♪♪]

365
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:49,959
NARRATOR:
Peppa is riding on her own,
without stabilizers!

366
00:16:49,959 --> 00:16:53,079
[BRAKES SCREECH]
Daddy! You let go!

367
00:16:53,079 --> 00:16:57,000
Ha, ha. You've been cycling
on your own for ages.

368
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,160
Have I?

369
00:16:58,160 --> 00:17:00,520
You're really
very good at it!

370
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:02,800
Am I?

371
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:06,079
Oh I can do it!
Look at me! Look at me!

372
00:17:06,079 --> 00:17:09,159
I can ride my bike properly.
[SNORTS]

373
00:17:09,159 --> 00:17:11,000
[RINGS BELL]

374
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,720
Danny! Suzy! Rebecca! Look!

375
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:16,919
I don't need
my stabilizers anymore!

376
00:17:16,919 --> 00:17:17,960
[SNORTS]

377
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,000
Look at me!
ALL: Hooray!

378
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,839
[ALL LAUGHING]

379
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:24,280
Race you
to Daddy's pumpkin!

380
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:27,359
[LAUGHING]
[BELLS RING]

381
00:17:27,359 --> 00:17:29,080
Wheeeee!
[RINGS BELL]

382
00:17:29,080 --> 00:17:31,440
Peppa, look out, my pumpkin!

383
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,200
[GRUNTS]
I'm going to win!

384
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:35,680
NARRATOR: Peppa isn't looking
where she is going!

385
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,399
[BRAKES SCREECH]
Wahhhh!

386
00:17:39,399 --> 00:17:41,320
[SPLOSH]
Whoops!

387
00:17:41,320 --> 00:17:42,800
NARRATOR:
Oh, dear.

388
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:46,080
Peppa has squashed
Daddy Pig's pumpkin!

389
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:49,080
Sorry I squashed
your pumpkin, Daddy.

390
00:17:49,080 --> 00:17:51,440
[SNORTS]
Never mind the pumpkin.

391
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:53,960
The important thing
is that you are okay.

392
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:57,120
In future, you really must
look where you are going.

393
00:17:57,120 --> 00:18:00,360
I promise I will, Daddy.
Good.

394
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:03,120
Anyway, now the pumpkin
is broken,

395
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:05,639
I can make it into
pumpkin pie!

396
00:18:05,639 --> 00:18:08,399
I love pumpkin pie!
[GRUNTS]

397
00:18:08,399 --> 00:18:11,200
And because Daddy Pig's
pumpkin is so big,

398
00:18:11,200 --> 00:18:14,360
there will be enough
pumpkin pie for everyone!

399
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:15,600
KIDS: Hooray!

400
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,879
[ALL LAUGH]

401
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:21,040
[♪♪♪]

402
00:18:21,040 --> 00:18:22,399
[GIGGLING, SNORTING]

403
00:18:22,399 --> 00:18:23,840
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

404
00:18:23,840 --> 00:18:26,800
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

405
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:28,480
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

406
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:31,040
[SNORTING, GIGGLING]

407
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:32,800
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

408
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:34,520
[SNORTS]

